(7181904, 1103924, 12076, '<td valign="top">OK.  Here is one with beautiful bokeh  where the bokeh is not the subject but enhances the image.  Simple, peaceful, fresh.  I think its a ribbon winner.</td>', 'OK.  Here is one with beautiful bokeh  where the bokeh is not the subject but enhances the image.  Simple, peaceful, fresh.  I think its a ribbon winner.', '2014-02-26 18:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181905, 1103923, 163430, '<td valign="top">Stop teasing the dog, already! :-)<br/> <br/>Love the idea, but i have remarks about the execution.<br/>- Is that motion blur or bokeh on the ears? looks like motin blur to me<br/>- Too much bokeh on the biscuit. <br/>- The composition is to  straight on for me. I would have went with a little pan to the left and the biscuit further to the camera left (closer to the lower left corner of the frame).</td>', 'Stop teasing the dog, already! :-) Love the idea, but i have remarks about the execution.- Is that motion blur or bokeh on the ears? looks like motin blur to me- Too much bokeh on the biscuit. - The composition is to  straight on for me. I would have went with a little pan to the left and the biscuit further to the camera left (closer to the lower left corner of the frame).', '2014-02-26 18:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
