(7181945, 1103857, 163430, '<td valign="top">All i see is half a lamppost in the foreground with no story to tell. And the colors are washed out too.<br/>Sorry :-(</td>', 'All i see is half a lamppost in the foreground with no story to tell. And the colors are washed out too.Sorry :-(', '2014-02-26 20:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181978, 1103283, 114285, '<td valign="top">I really love how this looks like the boats are floating high in the sky, not actually on the water. Really gives it a surreal look. The portrait crop enhances this vision, and the bokeh soft and delicate. <br/> <br/>To achieve such a perfectly exposed image in a minimal rule set shows, you are a master of your camera.<br/> <br/>This is the one to beat. 10</td>', 'I really love how this looks like the boats are floating high in the sky, not actually on the water. Really gives it a surreal look. The portrait crop enhances this vision, and the bokeh soft and delicate.  To achieve such a perfectly exposed image in a minimal rule set shows, you are a master of your camera. This is the one to beat. 10', '2014-02-26 22:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7181980, 1103927, 114285, '<td valign="top">I want to know why he has dirt all over him, just curious!<br/> <br/>And when you say doomsday book, which one, there are so many these days.</td>', 'I want to know why he has dirt all over him, just curious! And when you say doomsday book, which one, there are so many these days.', '2014-02-26 22:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
