(7182335, 1103927, 144365, '<td valign="top">And you win.<br/>If it wasn''t for the bokeh on your arm, there''d be now way to differentiate if this was foreground or background bokeh, and I would have slammed this entry. <br/> <br/><i>Create a photo in which bokeh is effectively used, but in the FOREGROUND of the image.</i> Most entries completely fail the first part of description. It''s only due to that fact am I giving this a ten.<br/> <br/>Have a good one Alex, looks like I''m getting the boot again.</td>', 'And you win.If it wasn''t for the bokeh on your arm, there''d be now way to differentiate if this was foreground or background bokeh, and I would have slammed this entry.  Create a photo in which bokeh is effectively used, but in the FOREGROUND of the image. Most entries completely fail the first part of description. It''s only due to that fact am I giving this a ten. Have a good one Alex, looks like I''m getting the boot again.', '2014-02-27 17:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
